 * 1. Admin creates a user profile for the member
 * 2. Admin assigns the user as a board member
 * 3. Admin creates a category for the topic
 * 4. Member creates a topic within the new category
 * 5. Member creates a post in the topic
 * 6. Member soft-deletes their post
 * 7. Confirm output: is_deleted is true for soft-deleted post
 */
