 * 5. Member soft-deletes (erase) the attachment (setting is_deleted=true).
 * 6. Invoke the delete endpoint a second time for the same attachment (already is_deleted=true).
 * 7. Test passes if no inconsistent state is created: API either returns success idempotently or signals redundant operation with meaningful error, never breaking business logic or data integrity.
 */
