 *    request (should not change body, but must not cause empty body issue).
 * 6. Confirm the comment body remains unchanged after each failed update attempt,
 *    i.e., no accidental modification.
 */
export async function test_api_my_discussion_board_comments_test_update_own_comment_to_empty_body(
