 * 3. Create a discussion category (admin operation) for topic linkage.
 * 4. Switch authenticated context to the first member; this user creates a new
 *    topic in the category.
 * 5. The first member subscribes to their own topic, producing a new topic
 *    subscription (obtain ID).
 * 6. Switch authentication to the second member (non-subscriber).
 * 7. Attempt to retrieve the first member's topic subscription by its ID as the
 *    second member—expect an authorization error (access denied).
 * 8. Verify no subscription data is returned and that an error (e.g., forbidden or
 *    not found) is raised.
 */
export async function test_api_discussion_board_test_get_topic_subscription_by_id_unauthorized_access(
